  "metadata": {
    "title": "neuroTUM-BCI: Cybathlon Dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18087806",
    "publication_date": "2025-12-29",
    "description": "<p>Dataset for the paper \"Improving motor imagery decoding methods for an EEG-based mobile brain-computer interface in the context of the 2024 Cybathlon\".</p>\n<p>Structure of the data:</p>\n<p>P0 - describes the anonymized identifier of the pilot.</p>\n<p>S0 - describes the recording session</p>\n<p>mapping.yaml - describes the mapping from the marker (given cue) to the class (performed action).</p>\n<p>data.xdf - recorded EEG data in the XDF file format. Recorded using an mBrainTrain Smarting EEG. Labelled data with markers for the three classes specified in the mapping.yaml.</p>\n<p>calibration.xdf - recorded calibration EEG data in the XDF file format. Recorded using an mBrainTrain Smarting EEG. Used for ASR calibration.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Data collected by neuroTUM e.V., Munich, Germany. (neurotum.com)</p>\n<p>Informed consent was obtained prior to data collection, usage, and publication.</p>",
